user_prompt_template:
Analyze the following startup idea:
Project Title: {project_title}
Startup Idea: {idea_title}
Problem Statement: {problem_statement}
Solution Description: {solution_description}
Target Users: {target_users}
Industry: {industry}
Business Model: {business_model}
Stage: {stage}

Provide the response strictly as a JSON object with: 'summary', 'score', 'strengths', 'weaknesses', 'recommendations', 'confidence', and 'dimensions' containing scores (0-100) for 'innovation', 'market_potential', 'technical_feasibility', 'business_viability', 'scalability', 'execution_complexity', 'competitive_differentiation'. Also include 'architecture_breakdown' as markdown.
